"tos_update_13_acceptance_footer" = "By tapping \"Agree and Continue\", you agree to our updated [Terms of Service](https://www.snap.com/terms/), [Snapchat+ Subscription Terms](https://www.snap.com/terms/paid-features), [Tokens Terms of Sale and Use](https://www.snap.com/terms/paid-features), and acknowledge that you have read the updated [Privacy Policy](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-policy). Beginning August 15, 2023, you will no longer be able to use Snapchat unless you agree to these updated terms.";
"tos_update_13_body" = "To understand all the changes please read the updates in full, but here are some of the key changes we’ve made:";
"tos_update_13_header" = "👋 We’re updating our [Terms of Service](https://www.snap.com/terms/), [Snapchat+ Subscription Terms](https://www.snap.com/terms/paid-features), [Tokens Terms of Sale and Use](https://www.snap.com/terms/paid-features), and [Privacy Policy](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-policy), which will go into effect on August 15, 2023.";
"tos_update_13_privacy_content" = " • Clarified how we use your information, including how we personalize our services, conduct research, and develop algorithms and machine learning models.\n • Linked to a new page in our [Privacy Center](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-center) that explains how we use your data for advertising and clarifies the choices you have.\n • Provided more transparency on how we collect and use content. For example, if you post basketball videos to Spotlight we may show you more basketball content.";
"tos_update_13_terms_content" = " • Updated the U.S. mandatory arbitration agreement, class action and jury trial waiver, and added an informal dispute resolution provision.\n • Clarified when we will make changes to our terms, and when we will notify you of these changes.\n • To help meet the requirements of the European Digital Services Act, we’ve provided additional information about personalization, content moderation, and our approach to terms of use enforcement.";
"tos_update_14_acceptance_footer" = "By tapping \"Agree and Continue\", you agree to our updated [Terms of Service](https://www.snap.com/terms) and [Paid Features Terms](https://snap.com/terms/paid-features), and acknowledge that you have read the updated [Privacy Policy](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-policy). Beginning February 26, 2024, you will no longer be able to use Snapchat unless you agree to these updated terms.";
"tos_update_14_body" = "Please read the updates in full, but here are some of the key changes we’ve made:";
"tos_update_14_header" = "We’re updating our [Privacy Policy](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-policy) and [Terms of Service](https://www.snap.com/terms), which will go into effect on February 26, 2024.";
"tos_update_14_india_blurb" = "All Snapchatters must abide by our Terms of Service, including our [Community Guidelines](https://values.snap.com/privacy/transparency/community-guidelines). You may not use Snapchat for illegal purposes, which, in India, includes not using Snapchat to send or post content that violates the Indian IT Rules 2021.\n\n";
"tos_update_14_privacy_content" = " • Added summaries to each section of the Policy to make them easier to understand.\n • More detail on how you can control your information, including downloading your data, who you share content with, and who can contact you.\n • More transparency on how we collect and use your information and content, with examples of what data we use for purposes like personalization, advertising, and building machine learning models.";
"tos_update_14_terms_content" = " • Further clarified that Snap is a personalized service.\n • If you live in the Asia-Pacific region, Snap Group Limited Singapore Branch is responsible for providing the services to you.\n • The terms for Snapchat+, Tokens, and streak restore are now included in the new [Paid Features Terms](https://snap.com/terms/paid-features).";
